# This site is fully static and needs NO environment variables or API keys to run.
# All demos (agents, RAG, MCP, telemetry) are local simulations.
#
# Personal values (GitHub, LinkedIn, email, site URL) live in assets/js/config.js,
# which is public by design. Never place secrets in this repository.
#
# Optional analytics (disabled by default). These are public identifiers, not secrets.
# If you enable analytics, copy the values into CONFIG.ANALYTICS in assets/js/config.js.
ANALYTICS_PROVIDER=
ANALYTICS_DOMAIN=
